.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt ZEROD 8
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm zerod
.Nd RavenBSD zero device server
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
registers the
.Dq zero:
scheme.
Each read fills the requested buffer with zero bytes and reports the full length; writes are
accepted and discarded.
The file mode reported by
.Dv FSTAT
is a character device with mode 0666.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/services.d -compact
.It Pa /etc/services.d/zerod.toml
Service manifest.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nulld 8 ,
.Xr randd 8 ,
.Xr init 8
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
